      "side": 1,
      "message": "Your proposed wording sounds fine - unless we want to go further and make SelectionPolicy a hard choice (ie, explicitly disable animation features in webp, even though it\u0027s not necessary).\n\nI\u0027m also ambivalent about this - like you said, this is a pretty wild edge-case -- but I think the CL is okay if you want to land it.",
